\par - Nh\'e0 \u7903\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng theo  h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi m\u7909\'3fc I Th\'f4ng t\'fd s\u7889\'3f 06 LB/TT ng\'e0y 10/2/1993 c\u7911\'3fa Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f
 X\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng - T\'e0i ch\'ednh. Nh\'e0 v\'e0 ki\u7871\'3fn tr\'fac kh\'e1c d\'f9ng \'f0\u7875\'3f l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc v\'e0 s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng b\u7857\'3fng v\u7889\'3fn NSNN \'f0\u7847
\'3fu t\'fd v\'e0 v\u7889\'3fn c\'f3 ngu\u7891\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa NSNN (k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f nh\'e0 do Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7883\'3fch thu khi \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng ch\'ednh s\'e1ch c\u7843\'3fi t\u7841\'3fo, nh\'e0 do c\'e1c t\u7893
\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc qu\u7889\'3fc t\u7871\'3f vi\u7879\'3fn tr\u7907\'3f cho Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f  v  . v . .) \'f0\u7873\'3fu l\'e0 nh\'e0 thu\u7897\'3fc s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par 2/ T\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c c\'f5 quan h\'e0nh  ch\'ednh s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc \'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f qu\u7847\'3fn ch\'fang, l\u7921\'3fc l\'fd\u7907\'3fng v\u361\'3f
 trang, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp, c\'f4ng ty, T\u7893\'3fng c\'f4ng ty, c\'e1c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp v . v . . . (d\'fd\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi chung l\'e0 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f) \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'e3 th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\'fd\u7899\'3f
