c nh\'fd \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'e3 n\'eau \u7903\'3f }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 1 m\u7909\'3fc n\'e0y, \'f0
\u7873\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn thu v\u7873\'3f b\'e1n quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y, bao g
\u7891\'3fm c\'e1c \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng ch\u7911\'3f y\u7871\'3fu sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par a) C\'e1c \'f0\'f5n  v\u7883\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft (k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f \'f0\u7845\'3ft do c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'fd), b\'e1n quy\u7873\'3fn khai th\'e1c s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm r\u7915\'3fng t\u7921\'3f nhi\'ean (b\'e1n c\'e2y }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f0\u7913\'3fng), b\'e1n nh\'e0 v\'e0 c\'e1c t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh kh\'e1c thu\u7897\'3fc s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. 
\par b) C\'e1c c\'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'fd Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'fd\u7899\'3fc v\u7873\'3f \'f0
\u7845\'3ft \'f0ai, th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft v\'e0 tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp thu ti\u7873\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc c\'e1c nh\'e2n \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c
