\par Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'e1c ng\'e0nh, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn b\'e1n t\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn \u7903\'3f tr\'ean c\'f3 nhu c
