\f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'ecnh, c\'e1 nh\'e2n nh\u7853\'3fn }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f0\u7845\'3ft khi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc giao \'f0\u7845\'3ft (d
\'fd\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi chung l\'e0 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\u7845\'3ft khi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc giao \'f0\u7845\'3ft) k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y Lu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\u7845\'3ft \'f0ai \'f0\'fd\u7907
\'3fc Qu\u7889\'3fc h\u7897\'3fi th\'f4ng qua ng\'e0y 14/7/1993 c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh, th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'ec ng}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'fd\u7901\'3fi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\u7845\'3ft khi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc giao \'f0\u7845\'3ft ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft v\'e0
o NSNN, tr\u7915\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par a) \'d0\u7845\'3ft giao \'f0\u7875\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\'e0o s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, l\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp, nu\'f4i tr\u7891\'3fng thu\u7927\'3f s\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 l\'e0m mu\u7889\'3fi; 
\par b) \'d0\u7845\'3ft giao \'f0\u7875\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\'e0o m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch c\'f4ng c\u7897\'3fng theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 58 Lu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\u7845\'3ft \'f0ai;
\par c) \'d0\u7845\'3ft giao \'f0\u7875\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\'e0o m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch th\'e3m d}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f2, khai }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
