\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f;
\par d) \'d0\u7845\'3ft do Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc cho c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc, c\'e1 nh\'e2n thu\'ea \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'e3 n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn thu\'ea }{\rtlch\fcs1 
