\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 t\'ednh ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0\u7845\'3ft trong gi\'e1 b\'e1n n\u7897\'3fp NSNN;
\par g) \'d0\u7845\'3ft giao \'f0\u7875\'3f chuy\'ean s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\'e0o m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch qu\u7889\'3fc ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f2ng, an ninh theo quy }{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 65 Lu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\u7845\'3ft \'f0ai.
\par \'d0\u7845\'3ft Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc giao cho c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc, c\'e1 nh\'e2n s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\'e0o c\'e1c m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch n\'eau t\u7841\'3fi ti\u7871\'3ft a, b, c, g \'f0i\u7875\'3fm n\'e0y n\u7871\'3fu chuy\u7875
\'3fn m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'ec ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f0\u7845\'3ft khi giao \'f0\u7845\'3ft nh\'fd c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp kh\'e1c.
\par Ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\u7845\'3ft khi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc giao \'f0\u7845\'3ft \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'e3 n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d
\u7909\'3fng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp v\'e0o NSNN quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm n\'e0y, th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
