\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 V\u7873\'3f nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc, ti\u7873\'3fn thu v\u7873\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft v\'e0 b\'e1n t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn thu\u7897\'3f
c s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f v\'e0o NSNN. Tuy nhi\'ean, \'f0\u7875\'3f c\'f3 ngu\u7891\'3fn b\'f9 \'f0\u7855\'3fp chi ph\'ed trong vi\u7879\'3fc t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc th\u7921\'3f
