\u7875\'3fm  2, m\u7909\'3fc I \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\u7841\'3fm gi\u7919\'3f l\u7841\'3fi 2% (hai ph\u7847\'3fn tr\'e3m) t\u7893\'3fng s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn thu v\u7873\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft v\'e0
 b\'e1n t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn (tr\u7915\'3f tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f c\'f4ng tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'ec
nh ho\'e0n th\'e0nh b\'e0n giao) }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'f0\u7875\'3f chi cho vi\u7879\'3fc t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tra, x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\'e1, k\'ea khai n\u7897
\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn v\'e0o NSNN. Cu\u7889\'3fi n\'e3m c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n vi\u7879\'3fc s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7919\'3f l\u7841\'3fi (2%) v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5
 quan T\'e0i ch\'ednh - Thu\u7871\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'fd \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
