\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o khung gi\'e1 chu\u7849\'3fn t\u7889\'3fi thi\u7875\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3f
nh 80/CP  ng\'e0y 5/11/1993 v\'e0 Th\'f4ng t\'fd s\u7889\'3f 32 TT/LB Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh - X\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng - T\u7893\'3fng C\u7909\'3fc \'f0\u7883\'3fa ch\'ednh - U\u7927\'3f ban v\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f, ph\'f9 h
