\'3fp chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc b\'e1n t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc ng\'e0y ban h\'e0nh Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y, ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft l\'e0 15 ng\'e0y k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng
\'e0y chuy\u7875\'3fn nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp chuy\u7875\'3fn nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng sau ng\'e0y ban h\'e0nh Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.
