\u7875\'3f h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn, ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0\'fang Ch\u7881\'3f th\u7883\'3f 154 /TTg c\u7911\'3fa Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f v\'e0 h\'fd
\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.
\par 5/ Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'fd. Nh\u7919\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t}
{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'fd s\u7889\'3f 60 TC/TCT ng\'e0y 16/7/1993 th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y. C\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e2y tr\'e1i v\u7899
\'3fi Ch\u7881\'3f th\u7883\'3f 154/TTg v\'e0 Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y \'f0\u7873\'3fu b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 \'e3i b\u7887\'3f.
\par Trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh th\u7921\'3fc }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8273109\charrsid3948147 hi\u7879\'3fn n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 v\'fd\u7899\'3fng m\u7855\'3fc, \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\'e1c ng\'e0nh, \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd
\'f5ng ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1nh k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi v\u7873\'3f B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh \'f0\u7875\'3f nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft ./.
